---
title: "Flags by size – flown"
---

extends /_/layouts/default

block body
  .flags.pb3
    ul.gr6.md-gr4.sm-gr2(style="gap: 1rem")
      - let prev
      each flag, i in flags.sort((a, b) => b.size.output - a.size.output)
        if prev && prev > 10000 && flag.size.output < 10000
          li
            .fx.pi1.flag(style={
              "background": "#fff2",
              "text-align": "center",
              "aspect-ratio": "5/3",
              "box-sizing": "border-box",
            })
              span.mba
                | All flags after this point meet the maximum 10kb threshold.

        - prev = flag.size.output

        +flag-list-item(flag)